  his family asylum he's trying to stay  positive  [Music]  we don't know what the status of our  applications for asylum is  but hard work is going into them  and the delegation from the u.s congress  came to visit here which certainly says  a lot  they're working on our cases and we  won't be forgotten  it sounds good but with each day that  passes their uncertainty grows and the  american aid organization looking after  ahmad's group has its hands tied  we are supporting them here in albania  but we are not their visa sponsors um  i know that uh  of course the overwhelming concern is  about being forgotten here in albania um  and and  being forgotten by the us government  here  on the albanian side the foreign  ministry is in charge of their cases but  no one here knows when the asylum  seekers will be accepted elsewhere  either  right now they're um we're taking all  the measures and we'll we're helping  while they uh it's transitory for some  of them that are um  going to embark and leave uh to the us  but of course if any of them would like  to make albania their home that is also  open and on the table but at the time  we're working on  with the visa process to for them to  leave the country  until then they will remain stuck in  their four-star resort home but the  seaside is at least a new experience for  them  we go on walks here in the morning it's  nice and so is the fresh breeze it's  really nice  the replica of the statue of liberty  shines in the dark in front of the hotel  but the refugees are still waiting for  their american dream to come true
 

